      "normative_level": "MUST NOT",
      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "client",
      "stage": "smtp_fsm",
      "description": "An originating SMTP client that has not successfully negotiated an appropriate extension with a particular server (see the next paragraph) MUST NOT transmit messages with information in the high-order bit of octets.",
